{"title":"Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"970\"\u003eBring Timeless Holiday Tradition Home with the Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1463\"\u003eCreate a warm and inviting holiday atmosphere with the Yorkshire Fir collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Inspired by the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, the Yorkshire Fir features natural green tones, full foliage, and a classic Christmas tree silhouette designed to bring holiday tradition into your space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1463\"\u003eCrafted with 100% PVC classic needles, the Yorkshire Fir offers a lush and uniform appearance that makes decorating effortless. Its full shape and dense branch structure provide plenty of space for ornaments, ribbon, and your cherished holiday decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1463\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the Yorkshire Fir collection makes it easy to find the right fit for your home, whether you are decorating a spacious area or a smaller corner that needs festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1463\"\u003eWhy choose the Yorkshire Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir is the ideal choice for those who love the classic, familiar look of a traditional Christmas tree. Its 100% PVC classic needle construction creates a consistently full and uniform shape once fully fluffed and set up. Warm, lush, and festive, the Yorkshire Fir is the kind of tree that is a dependable holiday classic that never goes out of style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eShould I choose the full or slim Yorkshire Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir collection is available in both full and slim silhouettes to suit different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir (full) provides a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with a bold and lush presence. Its fuller profile gives you ample space for \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e and decorative garland, making it ideal for open spaces or larger living rooms where you want a full tree as the centerpiece of your holiday decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir Slim delivers the same rich green foliage and classic silhouette in a narrower profile. It is a great option for apartments, smaller rooms, hallways, or corners where a full width tree would feel oversized. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Yorkshire Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir's traditional green foliage and classic silhouette make it a versatile match for any holiday decorating style. It pairs beautifully with traditional red and gold palettes, warm white lighting, and heirloom ornament collections. It also works well with neutral and natural aesthetics such as cream tones and rustic decor. \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/picks\" title=\"Decorative Picks\"\u003eTree picks\u003c\/a\u003e tucked throughout the branches add an extra layer of texture and fullness, making the Yorkshire Fir just as stunning with a curated, layered look as it is with a simple understated one.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow long does it take to shape the Yorkshire Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLike most 100% PVC classic artificial Christmas trees, the Yorkshire Fir benefits from a dedicated shaping session during the initial setup. Plan to spend up to 3 hours working through the branches, separating, fanning, and positioning each tip by hand to build out the fullness of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce properly shaped, the Yorkshire Fir should look full and lush from top to bottom. Many customers find that after the first season, the branches hold their shape and subsequent setups take less time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Yorkshire Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yorkshire Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarol's Christmas Conifers pre-lit Yorkshire Fir trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows warmly throughout the tree, creating a cozy and inviting holiday ambience. An included remote makes it easy to control your lighting from across the room, with 8 light functions. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless. No tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Yorkshire Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Yorkshire Fir is designed for easy setup and long-term durability. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, giving you a solid foundation to build on as you work through the shaping process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and arrange the branches comfortably. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen the holidays are over, disassemble the Yorkshire Fir, and store each section in its included storage bag in a cool, dry place to keep it in great condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the full Yorkshire Fir collection and find the size and silhouette that brings classic holiday warmth and tradition into your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642909257792,"sku":"YF-T7.5-U","price":279.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-10.jpg?v=1718158754"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642909388864,"sku":"YF-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1_04242c5f-9b81-4149-ad07-5298525c13ae.png?v=1722014825"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":37150212980936,"sku":"YF-T6.5-L","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1.png?v=1722014823"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37778112446664,"sku":"YFS-T6.5-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/YorkshireFirSlim.png?v=1722014899"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":37778112512200,"sku":"YFS-T7.5-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/yorkshire-fir-slim_f6153517-d6e6-49b0-ab68-8944a7598609.jpg?v=1722014819"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37778112544968,"sku":"YFS-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/YorkshireFirSlim_b25971d5-2ce0-4cef-b75d-280fcef0f242.png?v=1722014903"},{"product_id":"9-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":37778112577736,"sku":"YFS-T9-U","price":359.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/yorkshire-fir-slim_1442b025-0440-4e80-a86a-f3403c6620d9.jpg?v=1722014812"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Yorkshire_Fir.jpg?v=1722361957","url":"/\/collections\/yorkshire-fir-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}